WEBVTT

00:01:29.538 --> 00:01:32.704
a kind of limited version of the
multiple events happening at

00:01:32.704 --> 00:01:35.621
the core of things. And so
with this knowledge,

00:01:35.621 --> 00:01:38.538
I decided to do something that
I promised myself I would.

00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:42.288
And since the age of 13,
I reread the Koran.

00:01:43.121 --> 00:01:44.496
I wanted to see if there was anything

00:01:44.496 --> 00:01:47.371
I could find in there that would help
me find harmony between my career

00:01:47.371 --> 00:01:51.454
and Islamic identity, as if both could
coexist in me simultaneously,

00:01:51.621 --> 00:01:54.038
like those mischievous
subatomic particles.

00:01:54.579 --> 00:01:58.579
When I reread the Koran, I came across
these two wonderful passages about Allah

00:01:59.663 --> 00:02:04.288
that he is the one who shapes you in the
room as he pleases and of his signs.